    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740460/extras/ceed453f0ac7d184d918f2f76f8be376.avif?t=1752161808\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;BB Adventure&quot;</strong> is a physical action game in which you ride a real balance ball to clear athletic stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with an accelerometer-enabled controller, the movement and bouncing of the player\u2019s balance ball are directly reflected in the in-game character\u2019s actions, allowing you to experience a sense of immersion as if you have entered the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features &amp; Details</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Action Experience:</strong> The movement of the balance ball is directly reflected in the game, providing outstanding immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Controls:</strong> Utilizes motion sensors so that anyone can play easily.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health &amp; Fitness Benefits:</strong> Naturally trains your core and sense of balance while having fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Requirements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need the following to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A balance ball</strong> (for example, a ball with a diameter of about 65 cm is recommended for a person 170 cm tall)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An accelerometer-compatible controller</strong> (such as DUALSHOCK 4 or DualSense)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please also be sure to play safely.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740460/extras/ceed453f0ac7d184d918f2f76f8be376.avif?t=1752161808\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;BB Adventure&quot;</strong> is a physical action game in which you ride a real balance ball to clear athletic stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with an accelerometer-enabled controller, the movement and bouncing of the player\u2019s balance ball are directly reflected in the in-game character\u2019s actions, allowing you to experience a sense of immersion as if you have entered the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features &amp; Details</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Action Experience:</strong> The movement of the balance ball is directly reflected in the game, providing outstanding immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Controls:</strong> Utilizes motion sensors so that anyone can play easily.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health &amp; Fitness Benefits:</strong> Naturally trains your core and sense of balance while having fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Requirements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need the following to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A balance ball</strong> (for example, a ball with a diameter of about 65 cm is recommended for a person 170 cm tall)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An accelerometer-compatible controller</strong> (such as DUALSHOCK 4 or DualSense)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please also be sure to play safely.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cBB Adventure\u201d is an immersive action game where you ride a real balance ball and clear athletic stages. Using a controller with an accelerometer, your balance ball\u2019s movements control the in-game character, making you feel as if you\u2019re inside the game.",
